OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers' diesel cost almost
OL,4,Adoubles in 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's farmers have warned the
OL,7,Frising cost of diesel could force
OL,8,Fprices to increase for local milk, with
OL,9,Fnegotiations opening on 2027's price
OL,10,Flater.
OL,12,FPresident of the Guernsey Farmers
OL,13,FAssociation Michael Bray said the price
OL,14,Fof red diesel, which is used on his
OL,15,Ffarm, had jumped from 63p to #1.11 a
OL,16,Flitre since the start of 2026.
OL,18,FIt comes amid concerns about the cost
OL,19,Fof fuel from politicians, with moves to
OL,20,Ffreeze tax rises on petrol and diesel
OL,21,Fbeing put forward as part of Policy and
OL,22,FResources' 2027 budget.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
