OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers' diesel cost almost
OL,4,Adoubles in 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt most petrol stations across Guernsey
OL,7,Fthe price of diesel stands at #1.99 per
OL,8,Flitre.
